  "description": "ZIMVOI crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C82 H70 Br10 Gd4 N24 O16 S4,18(C2 H6 O1 S1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 5 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 5 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 5 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.811-4.273 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.89-127.78°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C110H154N24O30S18Br10Gd4.",
